      "text": "On June 15 and 16, 1955, a nation-wide Civil Defense test exercise will be held throughout the entire United States of America in cooperation with Canada. There can be no over-emphasis of the vital importance of civil defense to our national life. Full preparedness is essential. Every citizen must recognize and become aware of the tasks and needs of civil defense.",
